# Messy shop
> Typed by someone in a hurry.

platform: web

## Features

### Orders
Households order things.
for: [[Household]]
priority: must
must:
- Repeat every 1 to 8 weeks.
- Skipping takes one tap.
done when:
- [x] An order appears.
- [ ] Skipping removes it.

## Users
- **Household**: A family.
- Store admin: Keeps prices up to date.
